Contract oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Appends wrappers for the static contract helpers of Merc_Contract.cc (FindRefusalReason, ContractIsExpiring,
ContractIsGoingToExpireSoon), accessors for the saved renewal list and the sequence counters, a setter for the renewal
list, BeginRemoveMercFromContract (Assignments.cc), copies of the leave item list of Map_Screen_Interface.cc and
CalcNewSalary (Campaign.cc). No behaviour changes. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0006.

